    content: "<p><strong>One name on the marquee. 6 specialists behind the build.</strong></p>\n<p>You know Cleveland Clinic Neurological Institute. You might know the operator \u2014 <strong>Cleveland Clinic</strong>. But Cleveland Clinic Neurological Institute is not one company&rsquo;s product; it is an assembled system. Each system slot below is a different brand&rsquo;s specialty \u2014 <strong>every line backed by a published source</strong>.</p>\n<h2>The build, slot by slot</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>System slot</th><th>Supplier</th><th>Role</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Building Controls &amp; Automation</td><td><strong>Cleveland Clinic</strong></td><td>smart building with real-time location and gait assessment technology</td><td><a href=\"https://newsroom.clevelandclinic.org/2025/02/03/final-steel-beam-placed-on-cleveland-clinics-new-neurological-building\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Elevators</td><td><strong>Lerch Bates</strong></td><td>vertical transportation consulting for 20 elevators</td><td><a href=\"https://www.lerchbates.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurology/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>general construction</td><td><strong>Turner Construction</strong></td><td>construction manager for $1 billion 1-million-sq-ft neurological institute</td><td><a href=\"https://www.turnerconstruction.com/insights/turner-reaches-major-milestone-on-1-billion-cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>general construction</td><td><strong>Hopkins Architects</strong></td><td>design architect for 1-million-sq-ft neurological institute consolidating 15 centres</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hopkins.co.uk/projects/healthcare/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>general construction</td><td><strong>Stantec</strong></td><td>architect of record and healthcare planner for neurological institute</td><td><a href=\"https://healthcaredesignmagazine.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute-cleveland-first-look/158648/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>general construction</td><td><strong>LeMessurier</strong></td><td>structural engineer for neurological institute tower</td><td><a href=\"https://healthcaredesignmagazine.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute-cleveland-first-look/158648/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">source \u2197</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>In their own words</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Cleveland Clinic</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Patient flow will be aided with real-time location technology that will direct patients where to go as soon as they enter the facility. It also will be used to identify and maximize inpatient interactions with their caregiving team.&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Lerch Bates</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Vertical Transportation Consulting Services for 20 elevators \u2013 Cleveland Clinic&#x27;s Neurological Institute includes more than 300 medical, surgical and research specialists providing inpatient and outpatient care, imaging and surgical services for the treatments of adult and pediatric patients with neurological and psychiatric disorders.&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Turner Construction</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Spanning more than 1 million square feet, the cutting-edge facility is designed and being built to enhance inpatient and outpatient neurological care. It will house advanced imaging and surgical services, research and innovation laboratories, and collaborative treatment spaces focused on understanding and treating disorders of the brain, spine, and nerves.&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Hopkins Architects</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;In January 2020, Hopkins won a shortlisted competition to design a 1million sqft Neurological Institute for Cleveland Clinic at their main campus in Cleveland, Ohio. The new facility will consolidate 15 separate Neurological Centres into one major hospital building to facilitate interdisciplinary creativity and improve patient care.&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>Stantec</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;The project team, including Cleveland Clinic&#x27;s Buildings + Design, Hopkins Architects(design architect; London), and Stantec(architect of record, Cleveland), prioritized efficiency and flexibility in the facility layout.&rdquo;</li>\n<li><strong>LeMessurier</strong> \u2014 &ldquo;Engineers: LeMessurier (structural), Stantec (MEP), Karpinski (MEP)&rdquo;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why this matters</h2>\n<p>Famous places are <strong>one brand on the marquee, many brands behind the build</strong>. Diffr maps that hidden supply graph \u2014 every supplier and every venue is a brand, linked many-to-many, each link sourced. This is the B2B twin of <a href=\"/diffr/blog/the-decide-once-rule\">one brand per slot</a>.</p>\n<h2>Sources</h2><ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://newsroom.clevelandclinic.org/2025/02/03/final-steel-beam-placed-on-cleveland-clinics-new-neurological-building\">https://newsroom.clevelandclinic.org/2025/02/03/final-steel-beam-placed-on-cleveland-clinics-new-neurological-building</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lerchbates.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurology/\">https://www.lerchbates.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurology/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.turnerconstruction.com/insights/turner-reaches-major-milestone-on-1-billion-cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute\">https://www.turnerconstruction.com/insights/turner-reaches-major-milestone-on-1-billion-cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hopkins.co.uk/projects/healthcare/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute/\">https://www.hopkins.co.uk/projects/healthcare/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://healthcaredesignmagazine.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute-cleveland-first-look/158648/\">https://healthcaredesignmagazine.com/projects/cleveland-clinic-neurological-institute-cleveland-first-look/158648/</a></li>\n</ol>",
