    title: "Behind the Build: Who Actually Built Charit\u00e9 Campus Mitte?",
    description: "Charit\u00e9 Campus Mitte is one brand on the marquee \u2014 Charit\u00e9 \u2014 but the project runs on named specialists (Charit\u00e9, Ed. Z\u00fcblin, Siemens Healthineers, VAMED and more). Every supplier link below is verified with source_url + quote.",
    date: '2026-07-08',
