    description: "David Geffen Hall is one brand on the marquee \u2014 Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts \u2014 but the project runs on named specialists (Akustiks, Diamond Schmitt, Shen Milsom & Wilke, Thornton Tomasetti and more). Every supplier link below is verified with source_url + quote.",
